    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93005" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾰγάπηνον</span></b> , τό, a
		plant, prob. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Ferula
			persica</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.117
			</span></i>; also its <i>gum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				81
			</span></i>; and as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπὸς σαγαπηνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
				</span></i>
			 l.c., <i><span class="en">
				13.567
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαγᾰπηνίζω</span></b> , <i>smell</i> or <i>taste like it</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				14.55
			</span></i>.</div>
